{"symbol":"FHB.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:23Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Wielunska 2","city":"Rusiec","zip":"97-438","country":"Poland","phone":"48 43 676 60 20","fax":"48 43 676 68 87","website":"https://www.grupaFoodHub.pl","industry":"Packaged Foods","industryKey":"packaged-foods","industryDisp":"Packaged Foods","sector":"Consumer Defensive","sectorKey":"consumer-defensive","sectorDisp":"Consumer Defensive","longBusinessSummary":"FoodHub Spolka Akcyjna, together with its subsidiaries, operates in the food processing industry in Poland, European Countries, non-European Countries, and internationally. The company offers ready-made meals, canned meats, pâtés, soups, and spreads; oriental products soy sauces, chili sauces, rice noodles, coconut milks, and instant soups; and peas, corn, beans, broccoli, and cauliflower. It also sells meat and meat products, olive oils, and pasta; provides storage and logistics services, as well as contracting, plantation inspections, harvesting, and vegetable deliveries; and engages in the procurement of poultry and pork raw materials. The company sells its products through the traditional channel, sales, retail chains, and e-commerce under the private labels, including Pikok, Kraina Wedlin, Vegelogy, FineLife, Kuchnia Kachny, Gotove, Tradycyjny Smak, and Nasze Smaki, as well as Spichlerz Rusiecki, Sorella, and Goong brands. The company was formerly known as Pamapol S.A. and change its name to FoodHub Spolka Akcyjna in October 2025. The company was founded in 1993 and is based in Rusiec, Poland. FoodHub Spolka Akcyjna operates as a subsidiary of AMERYKANKA STRUKTURA Spolka z ograniczona odpowiedzialnoscia S.K.A.","fullTimeEmployees":988,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Pawel  Szataniak","title":"President of Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":81998,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Krzysztof  Polgrabia","title":"Vice President of Management Board for Corporate & F